@startuml lld-us16-sequence
title LLD-US16 Enforce the daily transfer limit: sequence diagram
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber
participant TransferService
participant LimitService
participant TransferRepo
TransferService -> LimitService : check(cust, 100000)
LimitService -> TransferRepo : sumToday(cust)
TransferRepo --> LimitService : 950000
LimitService --> TransferService : rejected
@enduml